name: ['Acornelia, Fashionable Filcher', 'Alexander Clamilton', 'Angelic Rocket', 'Animate Library', 'As Luck Would Have It', 'Avatar of Me', 'B-I-N-G-O', 'B.O.B. (Bevy of Beebles)', 'Baron Von Count', 'Better Than One', 'Blast from the Past', 'By Gnome Means', 'Clocknapper', 'Cramped Bunker', 'Do-It-Yourself Seraph', 'Dr. Julius Jumblemorph', 'Earl of Squirrel', 'Enter the Dungeon', 'Everythingamajig', 'Flavor Judge', 'Frankie Peanuts', 'Graveyard Busybody', 'Grusilda, Monster Masher', 'Handy Dandy Clone Machine', 'Hot Fix', 'Hydradoodle', 'Incite Insight', 'Ineffable Blessing', 'Infernal Spawn of Infernal Spawn of Evil', 'Infernius Spawnington III, Esq.', 'Infinity Elemental', 'Jackknight', 'Kindslaver', "Mary O'Kill", 'Masterful Ninja', 'Modular Monstrosity', 'Oddly Uneven', "Ol' Buzzbark", 'Old Fogey', 'Over My Dead Bodies', 'Phoebe, Head of S.N.E.A.K.', 'Pippa, Duchess of Dice', 'Richard Garfield, Ph.D.', 'Rules Lawyer', 'Serpentine', 'Spike, Tournament Grinder', 'Split Screen', 'Staying Power', 'Steamflogger of the Month', 'Summon the Pack', 'Surgeon General Commander', 'Sword of Dungeons & Dragons', 'Syr Cadian, Knight Owl', 'The Big Idea', 'The Countdown Is at One', 'The Grand Calcutron', 'Three-Headed Goblin', 'Watermarket', 'X', 'Yet Another Aether Vortex']
